MediaWithCrops.GetCropUrl — friendly extension in Umbraco.Extensions (Umbraco.Cms.Web.Common): `GetCropUrl(this MediaWithCrops?...)`? There's `GetCropUrl(this IPublishedContent, ...)` and `GetCropUrl(this MediaWithCrops, ...)` in ImageCropperTemplateCoreExtensions / friendly version. AGENTS.md says friendly ones in views: `media.GetCropUrl(width: 800, height: 450)` for MediaWithCrops or IPublishedContent. ✓

